# Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your values.

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

## Required Variables

```env
# OpenRouter API Key — get yours at https://openrouter.ai
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-key-here

# OpenRouter base URL (don't change unless proxying)
VITE_OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1

# Model to use — Gemini 2.0 Flash is fast and free-tier friendly
VITE_OPENROUTER_MODEL=google/gemini-2.0-flash-001
```

## Other good models to try on OpenRouter:
- `anthropic/claude-3.5-sonnet` — highest quality responses
- `google/gemini-2.0-flash-001` — fastest, great for demos (default)
- `openai/gpt-4o-mini` — balanced cost and quality
- `meta-llama/llama-3.1-70b-instruct` — open-source option
